[I] A JSON module for Lua based on the very fast RapidJSON library

[T] lua-rapidjson is a JSON encoding and decoding module for LuaJIT and Lua
[T] 5.1 to 5.3 based on the very fast RapidJSON C++ library, also supporting
[T] JSON schema validation.

[U] https://github.com/xpol/lua-rapidjson

